# sink()  unknown.x = 1
# A call of a value nobody knows raises ValueNobodyKnowsIsCalled (h23) and a store into an object nobody knows raises ObjectNobodyKnowsIsWritten (h17). `timeline` lists who raised each flag of the host.
# RUN: valueflow-why timeline
# CHECK: flag h23
# RUN(WRITTEN): valueflow-why timeline
# WRITTEN: flag h17

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v1 = PropGet v0 key="sink" [isFreeName]
    v2 = Call v1, -
    v3 = Integer integer=1
    PropSet v2, v3 key="x"
    Return v2
}
